{"script":"sj_037_02","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara037_1","mirrow":false,"x":130,"trans":true,"y":-405,"noOut":false,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara037_1_face_chara037_1f","noIn":false,"scaleY":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara037_1","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":130,"trans":true,"y":-405,"noOut":false,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara037_1_face_chara037_1f","noIn":false,"scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"剋","text":"[show]我门中曾有偈曰：“八风吹不动，端坐紫金莲。”[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_11"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara037_1_face_chara037_1c","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"剋","text":"[show]意思是修行者面对利，衰，毁，誉，称，讥，苦，乐共八种境遇，依然要守身持正，不偏不倚。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara037_1_face_chara037_1f","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"剋","text":"[show]无论住得好、住得坏，于吾而言，都是一般修持，毫无分别。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara037_1_face_chara037_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"剋","text":"[show]况且，这营地是施主自己所建，其中寒暑苦乐如何，又何必询问他人意见？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara037_1_face_chara037_1f","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"剋","text":"[show]比起往日虎斗院广厦千顷、炼气士过万的景象，这小小的营地，自然简陋不堪。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara037_1_face_chara037_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"剋","text":"[show]但比起沼泽深林、洞穴魔窟，这安全的营地，却是宛如净土。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"剋","text":"[show]终究这营地好与不好，还是要看施主自己如何看待。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara037_1_face_chara037_1g","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"剋","text":"[show]我心安处是家乡，施主当自己斟酌才是。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara037_1_face_chara037_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"剋","text":"[show]不过若是你一定要听吾的意见……吾只有八字相赠。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara037_1_face_chara037_1g","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"剋","text":"[show]有道是“水不在深，有龙则灵”啊！[l][cm][hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_13"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara037_1","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":130,"trans":true,"y":-405,"noOut":false,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara037_1_face_chara037_1g","noIn":false,"scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"","text":"[hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"剋-在这里住的还舒服吗？"}